<title>UK: India's CESC to launch 7-year dollar FRN.</title>
<headline>India's CESC to launch 7-year dollar FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Indian utility CESC Ltd (Calcutta Electricity Supply Corp) is to issue a seven-year dollar-denominated FRN, ANZ Investment Bank said on Friday as lead manager.</p>
<p>ANZ said the deal would likely be launched in April. CESC has the licence for the generation, transmission and sole distribution of electricity to Calcutta and adjoining areas in the state of West Bengal.</p>
<p>It is among the 10 largest Indian firms in terms of assets.</p>
<p>-- Dan Lalor, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
